These small SVG pictures are byte-for-byte or whitespace-only copies of files in Herdr 0.1.12's shipped mods, placed in
the mod folder that draws them (a mod may not load another mod's files: Herdr replaces its shipped mods on every update).
The folder after the arrow is where the file comes from in Herdr.

What Herdr says about them. Herdr's repository (`defaults/icons/LICENSES.md`) states: "Glyphs ... including icons in
