4. Bundled from another repository of the same author (Apache License 2.0)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

  mods/attention-picker/           the "Agents waiting" dialog

  A bundled, unmodified copy of the mod of the same name in the herdr-agents-waiting repository (Apache License 2.0,
  same copyright holder), at the commit recorded in scripts/bundled.json, which also holds the SHA-256 of every file;
  `node scripts/validate.mjs` fails if one differs. It is kept in sync from there; edit it there, not here. Its two
  small pictures (the search glyph and the spinner) are that project's own drawings, made for it, and are not Herdr's
  files: see that repository's NOTICE. If you already have that mod installed, keep yours.

  mods/portrait-viewer/logic.mjs   part of it

  The platform helpers (opening files, file stamps, finding Poppler, image headers, install hints) are copied
  unchanged from mods/vault-reader/platform.js of the herdr-obsidian-vault repository (Apache License 2.0, same
  copyright holder); the picture cache is a trimmed copy of that mod's assets-core.js (pictures and PDF pages only,
  cached under data/portrait-viewer/cache). The rest of the viewer is original to this repository.


